{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"unchanged-shrubby-galah","creation_channel":"cli","description":"# Deletions that reach HEAD through a merge are invisible to the restore\n\n`fsck_repair._deleted_history` enumerates deleted event files with\n`git log --diff-filter=D --name-only -- <tid>/`. Plain `git log` does NOT show diffs for\nMERGE commits, so any event removed by a COMPACT that reached HEAD via a merge is never\nfound, and `restore_deleted_sources` silently cannot recover it.\n\n## Evidence\nTicket f130-3fab-a9f6-4fd0 kept a SNAPSHOT_MISSING_SOURCES finding after the b636 remediation\nsweep. Its missing source a440f6d5-6aa1-4669-9908-5fb955ad6a53 is an EDIT carrying the\nticket's 2719-char description.\n- `_deleted_history` returned no record for it.\n- `git log --all --follow --name-status -- <path>` DID: deleted by COMPACT commits\n  425b66f25e and 08ce74baf5, added by ba6862850b / 79fbc268e6.\nThe event was recovered by hand from ba6862850b and the ticket now reduces correctly, so the\ndata was always reachable — only the enumeration was blind.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `_deleted_history` finds deletions recorded in merge commits (e.g. `--full-history`\n      plus a diff-merges mode, or an `--all`-scoped walk), verified against a fixture whose\n      deletion is introduced by a merge rather than a first-parent commit.\n- [ ] NEWEST-deletion-wins semantics are preserved when merge commits enter the stream.\n- [ ] Held-out test: an event deleted only via a merge commit is restored.\n- [ ] Re-running the sweep over the live store finds nothing further (f130 already\n      hand-fixed; expect zero new recoveries or an explained list).","id":"85fa-99e1-c81b-4fa2","parent_id":"","priority":1,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"restore_deleted_sources misses events deleted in a merge commit (git log --diff-filter=D skips merges)"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786296594295519001,"uuid":"8d7ab1d1-d6a6-44c2-a1a1-d0be5af127f4"}